AiezzaUtils
AiezzaUtils is a lightweight collection of Swift utilities designed to simplify common development tasks.
It includes helper modules such as email validation, date formatting utilities, and optional SwiftUI UI components.
The package is fully modular, documented, and ready to be imported into any iOS project via Swift Package Manager (SPM).
🔗 Installation (Swift Package Manager)
You can add AiezzaUtils to your project directly through Xcode:
File → Add Packages…
Then enter the URL:
https://github.com/SEU_USUARIO/AiezzaUtils.git
Or add it directly to your Package.swift:
.package(url: "https://github.com/SEU_USUARIO/AiezzaUtils.git", from: "1.0.0")
Then include it inside your target:
.target(
    name: "YourApp",
    dependencies: [
        .product(name: "AiezzaUtils", package: "AiezzaUtils"),
        .product(name: "AiezzaUI", package: "AiezzaUtils") // if using the UI module
    ]
)
🧰 Modules Included
✔️ AiezzaUtils
Core utilities such as:
EmailValidator
import AiezzaUtils

let isValid = EmailValidator.isValid("example@email.com")
print(isValid) // true or false
DateFormatterUtils
import AiezzaUtils

let date = Date()
let formatted = DateFormatterUtils.formattedString(from: date)
print(formatted) // "2025-01-01"
🎨 AiezzaUI (optional module)
Reusable SwiftUI components, such as:
AsyncImageView
import SwiftUI
import AiezzaUI

struct ContentView: View {
    var body: some View {
        AsyncImageView(url: URL(string: "https://picsum.photos/300")!)
            .frame(width: 200, height: 200)
            .clipShape(RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 16))
    }
}
🧪 Unit Tests
This package includes unit tests demonstrating:
Email validation correctness
Date parsing and formatting consistency
UI behavior tests (if applicable)
To run tests:
⌘ + U (Xcode)
or
swift test
